<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Combination drench shower and eye/face wash, <RID>ANSI/ISEA Z358.1</RID>.  Mount components on a minimum<MET> 32 mm</MET><ENG> 1-1/4 inch</ENG>
