 3 gpm</ENG> of aerated water at<MET> 207 kPa</MET><ENG> 30 psig</ENG> flow pressure.  Provide a minimum<MET> 203 mm</MET><ENG> 8 inch</ENG> diameter shower head.  
Provide<MET> 25 mm</MET><ENG> 1 inch</ENG> IPS chrome-plated brass stay-open shower valve with stainless steel actuating arm and pull 
