of copper alloy or corrosion resistant steel.  Install showerhead<MET> 1829 mm</MET><ENG> 72 inches</ENG> above finished floor.  Combination 
thermostatic and pressure anti-scald balancing valve, with chrome plated metal lever with adjustment for rough-in 
