of <MET>5.7 L/min </MET><ENG> 1.5 gpm</ENG> when measured at a flowing water pressure of<MET> 414 kPa</MET><ENG> 60 psig</ENG>.  Provide chrome plated<MET> 10 
mm</MET><ENG> 3/8 inch</ENG> OD soft-copper tube supplied with escutcheons, and loose key stops.  Provide chrome plated<MET> 40 mm</MET><ENG> 
