arm with escutcheon.  Provide separate<MET> 40 mm</MET><ENG> 1.5 inch</ENG> P-trap and drain piping to vertical vent piping from each 
compartment.  Coordinate hole quantities, locations, and centerings with faucet types indicated in fixture descriptions.  
