]<SPT><TTL>Sink, Surgeons Scrub</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>SSS-1 (JSN P6980)</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Three station, wall-mounted, gooseneck spouts, knee push controls.  Provide seamless welded <MET>1.59 mm</MET><ENG>16 gage</ENG> construction, 
