timing device to reduce tampering.  Provide plastic splash shield between each compartment.  Provide foot-controlled 
soap dispensers at each compartment.  Provide sink with 120 volt, 2 ampere power to an internal junction box.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
]</SPT><SPT><TTL>Urinals</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide <RID>ASME A112.19.2/CSA B45.1</RID>, white vitreous china, wall-mounted, wall outlet, urinals with integral trap, 
