chair carriers.  Provide urinals equipped with flush valves with a flushing volume of the urinal and flush valve 
combination not exceeding the fixture design rating.  Mount flush valves not less than<MET> 279 mm</MET><ENG> 11 inches</ENG> above 
the fixture.</TXT><BRK/>
