<BRK/>
<TXT>High efficiency washout for solenoid valve.  Provide WaterSense labeled urinal with a maximum water use of<MET> 1.9 
Lpf</MET><ENG> 0.5 gpf</ENG>.  Provide data identifying WaterSense label for urinal.  Flushing cycle must be activated by an electronic 
infrared sensor operated by proximity of individual.  [Provide wiring box, 120/24 volt solenoid, and transformer.] 
