 diameter isolation floor drain body with flange, integral clamping collar, and standpipe.]</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
]<SPT><TTL>FD-4</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  FD-4 intended for use in kitchens.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT><MET>305 mm</MET> <ENG>12 inch</ENG> diameter invertible flashing collar, <MET>178 mm</MET> <ENG>7 inch</ENG> deep body, stainless steel sediment basket 
