<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT><SPT><TTL>Floor Sinks</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide floor sinks with [type 304 stainless steel bodies]  [coated [galvanized] cast iron bodies, with acid-resisting 
interior,] and double drainage pattern for embedding in the floor construction, and seepage pan having weep holes 
or channels for drainage to the drainpipe.  Provide an integral clamping device for attaching flashing or waterproofing 
